.TH "CSSROTATE.ANGLE" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSRotate.angle \- CSSRotate: angle property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]angle\f[B]\f[R] property of the \f[CR]CSSRotate\f[R]
interface gets and sets the angle of rotation.
A positive angle denotes a clockwise rotation, a negative angle a
counter\-clockwise one.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]CSSNumericValue\f[R]
